    <string name="tabir_guide_title">How to use Tabir</string>
    <string name="tabir_guide_body">1. Open the Apps tab and tap any banking, game, or detector app.\n\n2. Enable Per-app Shield and choose Whitelist (recommended for banking &amp; games: hides all other user apps &amp; ROM packages except what you allow) or Blacklist (hides selected targets).\n\n3. Use Templates to reuse rules across many apps, or enable Bulk Select in the Apps tab to shield multiple apps in one tap.\n\n4. Use View as to verify exactly what an app can and cannot see.</string>

